          1*       <136> ECHO                                                      OP1[  IS_CONST (268435443) '%3Cdiv+class%3D%22body_padded%22%3E%0D%0A%09%3Ch1%3EHelp+-+Cross+Site+Scripting+%28Reflected%29%3C%2Fh1%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%3Cdiv+id%3D%22code%22%3E%0D%0A%09%3Ctable+width%3D%27100%25%27+bgcolor%3D%27white%27+style%3D%22border%3A2px+%23C0C0C0+solid%22%3E%0D%0A%09%3Ctr%3E%0D%0A%09%3Ctd%3E%3Cdiv+id%3D%22code%22%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EAbout%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3E%22Cross-Site+Scripting+%28XSS%29%22+attacks+are+a+type+of+injection+problem%2C+in+which+malicious+scripts+are+injected+into+the+otherwise+benign+and+trusted+web+sites.%0D%0A%09%09%09XSS+attacks+occur+when+an+attacker+uses+a+web+application+to+send+malicious+code%2C+generally+in+the+form+of+a+browser+side+script%2C%0D%0A%09%09%09to+a+different+end+user.+Flaws+that+allow+these+attacks+to+succeed+are+quite+widespread+and+occur+anywhere+a+web+application+using+input+from+a+user+in+the+output%2C%0D%0A%09%09%09without+validating+or+encoding+it.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EAn+attacker+can+use+XSS+to+send+a+malicious+script+to+an+unsuspecting+user.+The+end+user%27s+browser+has+no+way+to+know+that+the+script+should+not+be+trusted%2C%0D%0A%09%09%09and+will+execute+the+JavaScript.+Because+it+thinks+the+script+came+from+a+trusted+source%2C+the+malicious+script+can+access+any+cookies%2C+session+tokens%2C+or+other%0D%0A%09%09%09sensitive+information+retained+by+your+browser+and+used+with+that+site.+These+scripts+can+even+rewrite+the+content+of+the+HTML+page.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EBecause+its+a+reflected+XSS%2C+the+malicious+code+is+not+stored+in+the+remote+web+application%2C+so+requires+some+social+engineering+%28such+as+a+link+via+email%2Fchat%29.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%3Chr+%2F%3E%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EObjective%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EOne+way+or+another%2C+steal+the+cookie+of+a+logged+in+user.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%3Chr+%2F%3E%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3ELow+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3ELow+level+will+not+check+the+requested+input%2C+before+including+it+to+be+used+in+the+output+text.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cpre%3ESpoiler%3A+%3Cspan+class%3D%22spoiler%22%3E%3Fname%3D%26lt%3Bscript%26gt%3Balert%28%22XSS%22%29%3B%26lt%3B%2Fscript%26gt%3B%3C%2Fspan%3E.%3C%2Fpre%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EMedium+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThe+developer+has+tried+to+add+a+simple+pattern+matching+to+remove+any+references+to+%22%26lt%3Bscript%26gt%3B%22%2C+to+disable+any+JavaScript.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cpre%3ESpoiler%3A+%3Cspan+class%3D%22spoiler%22%3EIts+cAse+sENSiTiVE%3C%2Fspan%3E.%3C%2Fpre%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EHigh+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThe+developer+now+believes+they+can+disable+all+JavaScript+by+removing+the+pattern+%22%26lt%3Bs%2Ac%2Ar%2Ai%2Ap%2At%22.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cpre%3ESpoiler%3A+%3Cspan+class%3D%22spoiler%22%3EHTML+events%3C%2Fspan%3E.%3C%2Fpre%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EImpossible+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EUsing+inbuilt+PHP+functions+%28such+as+%22' ]
